Imported Elixir standard-library, ExUnit, Logger, parser, tokenizer, and
Unicode-tokenizer sources are documented file by file in licenses/sources.json.
Documentation/specifications were removed where indicated; native-runtime,
compiler, and compatibility adaptations were made by Tonic contributors.
Calendar/characters/exception sources include adapted upstream code.
The upstream Elixir NOTICE is reproduced verbatim below and in
licenses/elixir/notice.txt; its license is in licenses/elixir/license.txt.

Erlang/OTP 27.3, https://github.com/erlang/otp/tree/OTP-27.3
